# WebOrb

> WebOrb is a UK-based web design agency that builds fast, professional websites
> exclusively for trades and local service businesses — electricians, plumbers,
> builders, roofers, garages, landscapers and more. We focus on websites that
> rank on Google and convert visitors into paying customers.

## About

WebOrb is run by experienced developers with 50+ delivered projects
professionally. We work only with UK tradespeople, which means deep knowledge
of the market, the customers, and what a trades website needs to say and do.
No outsourcing. No junior handoffs. You deal directly with the people building
your site.

## Services

- **Web Design & Development**: Custom-designed, mobile-optimised websites
  delivered in 2 weeks. Includes design, copywriting, development, contact
  forms, hosting setup, and on-page SEO.
- **Local SEO**: Ranking your website for searches like "electrician in [city]"
  or "plumber near me". Includes keyword optimisation, Google Maps visibility,
  and monthly ranking reports.
- **Google Business Profile**: Setup and optimisation of your Google Business
  Profile — the listing that appears in Google Maps and local search results.
- **Landing Pages & Ads**: Conversion-focused landing pages paired with Google
  Ads campaigns, including call tracking.

## Pricing

- **Starter**: £799 one-off or £79/month — 5-page website, mobile-optimised,
  basic on-page SEO, contact form.
- **Growth** (most popular): £1,499 one-off or £149/month — 10 pages, full
  Local SEO campaign, Google Business Profile, 3 months support.
- **Pro**: Custom pricing — everything in Growth plus Google Ads management,
  monthly SEO management, priority support, quarterly strategy calls.

